 "explanation": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "server i needs t_i = ceil(health[i] / k) consecutive hits and costs request[i] per round until it falls; ordering servers by t_i / request[i] ascending (exchange argument, compared by integer cross-multiplication) minimises sum request[i] * finish round. Complexity target: O(n log n) time/O(n) space.",
  "provenance": [
   {
